    "source": "use numbers\nuse ranges\n\nfun infixmax N\n Op = max\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  Best = Best max I\n end\n return Best\nend\n\nfun aliasmax N\n Op = max\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  Best = Best I Op\n end\n return Best\nend\n\nfun infixmin N\n Op = min\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  Best = Best min (-I)\n end\n return Best\nend\n\nfun aliasmin N\n Op = min\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  Best = Best (-I) Op\n end\n return Best\nend\n\nfun arithmetic N\n Op = max\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  Best += I\n end\n return Best\nend\n\nfun conditional N\n Op = max\n Best = 0\n for I in 0 until N\n  if I greater Best\n Best = I\n end\n end\n return Best\nend",
